him to follow the guidance of grace to the Erdtree that looms over the Lands Between. But it won't be an easy road; a cast of colorful characters awaits Aseo along the way—Patches the Untethered, Blaidd the Half-Wolf, Margit the Fell Omen, Godrick the Grafted, and of course, Ranni the Witch... With little but a loincloth between Aseo and certain death, he strikes out for the first stop on his quest: Stormveil Castle. Will he make it there, or will his journey end before it even begins?\n___\n**Official English Volumes:** [Yen Press](https://yenpress.com/series/elden-ring-the-road-to-the-erdtree)\n___\n**Note:** Aside from the original Japanese, this series is being digitally simulpubbed in English, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Italian, Korean, Polish, Portuguese, Spanish, Latin American Spanish, and Thai. ([ANN](https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2022-09-04/new-elden-ring-gag-manga-launches-with-publication-in-12-languages/.189310))","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/455bfa6f-e355-4996-8d0c-dbdc55f17ffc/9049a076-a0fa-47ad-8c1e-8a0908368f87.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["vi","en","es"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.09,"follows":5125,"listAt":"2026-10-23T04:01:48.455Z","chapters":[{"id":"daa5fe71-150e-4a82-b9eb-0f804a665a2d","number":"49","volume":null,"title":"Watch out for the real one!","lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2025-03-11T22:12:42+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"05b3b63a-ec81-40c0-8547-efb5aa52fcdb","number":"48","volume":null,"title":"Head for the Eternal City, Nokron!","lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2025-03-11T21:27:16+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"254bdb57-91d7-4e31-985d-839b3df2cc58","number":"47","volume":null,"title":"You'd think we're allies, right?","lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2025-03-11T04:40:05+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":3,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-22T13:06:55.2